<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:18Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Indonesia: Thousands fall sick from free school meals</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2f0e22fe0aafe3187e2265bfa67b837c6fe93656f102dd4b31e6b2b9b6cd3a92</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:21:57Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T17:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/indonesia-thousands-fall-sick-from-free-school-meals/a-78894485--1f4b914646b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/indonesia-thousands-fall-sick-from-free-school-meals/a-78894485?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hundreds of new food poisoning cases have been reported this week linked to President Prabowo Subianto's free school lunch program. The costly scheme has been dogged by health concerns and allegations of corruption.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump's Iran strategy: Could this become a forever war?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:18271fa89c30bc16bf372e88ef2d47c0b6b38001624cf91c43a293dce022ea83</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:00Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T17:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-s-iran-strategy-could-this-become-a-forever-war/a-78875030--3090496038f1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-s-iran-strategy-could-this-become-a-forever-war/a-78875030?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US has launched fresh attacks on military targets in Iran. It wants to prevent Tehran rebuilding its destroyed capabilities, but risks triggering a sustained downward spiral of reconstruction followed by new attacks.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Berlin BER airport Terminal 1 evacuated after security scare</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:10343ccda4567d3b669bd7c4ca3356a048bacaff20ff25658b4e8b44e1e0c958</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T17:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/berlin-ber-airport-terminal-1-evacuated-after-security-scare/a-78895207--7a0bcc429d5c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/berlin-ber-airport-terminal-1-evacuated-after-security-scare/a-78895207?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities have emptied Terminal 1 at BER airport in Berlin, at least as a precaution. The airport said that more than two-dozen flights had been delayed but that they were trying to avoid any cancellations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Norway seizes Russian ship in Svalbard to compensate Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8e81d9727b72846bb8af571466a19c1baae76ce265a40d923c15c6dd27a3ba98</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T15:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/norway-seizes-russian-ship-in-svalbard-to-compensate-ukraine/a-78889005--71c4decbfa77.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/norway-seizes-russian-ship-in-svalbard-to-compensate-ukraine/a-78889005?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities in Norway have seized a Russian ship, the Professor Molchanov, on a court order sought and obtained by Naftogaz in Ukraine. Russia has protested the move, which stems from its refusal to pay Naftogaz damages.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: From emigration to immigration destination</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:667694ed1b15fecd6e316c50f8c846b6fb3e0e0af334f6523e4cdc6489231404</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:09Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T15:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-from-emigration-to-immigration-destination/a-78805541--f9fc9d25be83.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-from-emigration-to-immigration-destination/a-78805541?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Migration is a sensitive topic in Germany, with public debate dominated by the fear of uncontrolled immigration. People forget that, over two centuries, millions of Germans emigrated in search of a better life.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>US sanctions halt TOEFL and GRE tests in Iran, disrupting study plans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a52e98238978f0424c8486b9474860a9e141aed531d9f15ff3603ec502ac2e4</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T14:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-halt-toefl-and-gre-tests-in-iran-disrupting-study-plans/a-78764639--eb09c13fa9f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-sanctions-halt-toefl-and-gre-tests-in-iran-disrupting-study-plans/a-78764639?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Students in Iran can no longer take English-language proficiency exams after the suspension of a US sanctions exemption. Applicants say the move threatens university deadlines and adds costly travel obligations.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Putin denies fresh mobilization campaign in Ukraine war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:14fa1638d9bb9b709495b4c82a49c33645af07d42d4d675ad9d72dd78819dbf3</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:15Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T14:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/putin-denies-fresh-mobilization-campaign-in-ukraine-war/a-78843002--a81f3c99a503.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/putin-denies-fresh-mobilization-campaign-in-ukraine-war/a-78843002?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Russian president said there was no present need to mobilize more men, describing the reports as Ukrainian "disinformation." Putin was speaking during an economic forum in Russia's east.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Can Hichilema heal Zambia's political divide?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ac0ca0b1f8707c72aca37622ad811215f2feeed9cfbba7cdad88ca4e350b17b4</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:22:18Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-hichilema-heal-zambia-s-political-divide/a-78876039--46147b09dc5c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-hichilema-heal-zambia-s-political-divide/a-78876039?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Zambian president starts a second term after a contested election exposed deep political divisions. His challenge now is to unite the country while addressing concerns over political freedoms.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia to buy Hugging Face in $12.93 billion deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:762cfe478eebf1d89c67c8d5922921a1ff61bc032fc7b3b2b421733dff25fec2</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-to-buy-hugging-face-in-12-93-billion-deal/a-78883442--c615ab6238e5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-to-buy-hugging-face-in-12-93-billion-deal/a-78883442?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The AI chip maker said it would keep Hugging Face an open platform that would not require developers to use Nvidia hardware.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Africa airline behind viral stadium flyby scraps repeat display</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bc173a0976e74f629f825dc2a9aa4bb15c7d43106763fad76ebdbea47ee58205</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-africa-airline-behind-viral-stadium-flyby-scraps-repeat-display/a-78870028--d7eeef7f9195.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-africa-airline-behind-viral-stadium-flyby-scraps-repeat-display/a-78870028?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two passenger jets passed close to Cape Town's DHL Stadium during a flyover last weekend. The carrier said it has shelved plans to repeat the display as South Africa's aviation authority investigates the event.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Is Germany's economic slump finally over?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9769b006eb4b6354a49987471ab6545625bcac19120fd0af338ffae3de15ed6b</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-germany-s-economic-slump-finally-over/a-78815447--95acbfe46f77.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-germany-s-economic-slump-finally-over/a-78815447?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite a slew of negative headlines, the German economy has posted its best figures in years. There are reasons for optimism, but structural issues remain.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Malaysia's middle path between China and US faces new tests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3052e7b132a6a201e9397c16e72747373dff21b4e4f881f893e7a8fd0a305e7</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/malaysia-s-middle-path-between-china-and-us-faces-new-tests/a-78865212--dea46f61380d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/malaysia-s-middle-path-between-china-and-us-faces-new-tests/a-78865212?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The prime minister's comments on Taiwan and US-backed military facilities near Sabah have revived questions over Malaysia's non-aligned foreign policy.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Iran bets on shadow networks to evade US sanctions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5caa8070270415368f58fa3bd626f25e76557022a57c54850bf5265d62628976</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T11:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-bets-on-shadow-networks-to-evade-us-sanctions/a-78863283--3c3e4a5c1925.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-bets-on-shadow-networks-to-evade-us-sanctions/a-78863283?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">To circumvent US sanctions, Iran has spent decades building a complex network of businesspeople and companies. A billionaire once sentenced to death is now back at its center.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Jaishankar offers help to end war in Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bcd6bd7a13f5b310cdb858555fc903d4eac833ece38a7a3bf56d5f99f94816a4</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T11:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-jaishankar-offers-help-to-end-war-in-ukraine/live-78815659--b74d6f775fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-jaishankar-offers-help-to-end-war-in-ukraine/live-78815659?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Foreign Minister S. Jaishankar says India is prepared to assist efforts to end the war in Ukraine, as the foreign minister visits Kyiv. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Gloria Steinem, feminist activist and journalist, dies at 92</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:caf037e2d125f188e6fc9c263ddcf03296454e1d11ec31de5d2211db6a5e49a0</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T10:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gloria-steinem-feminist-activist-and-journalist-dies-at-92/a-78855039--0f5631bbb8e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/gloria-steinem-feminist-activist-and-journalist-dies-at-92/a-78855039?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Steinem became a prominent leader of the second wave of the feminist movement in the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Supersized' El Nino could be strongest on record, UN says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae7ce3d063605c7f64671a82cbf0b8bdaf6f1a139f09a7c4defa168b9b68c5aa</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T09:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/supersized-el-nino-could-be-strongest-on-record-un-says/a-78841246--1ae35f02a59e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/supersized-el-nino-could-be-strongest-on-record-un-says/a-78841246?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The current El Nino could end up being the strongest since records began 40 years ago, the UN warns. It says the phenomenon is being "supersized" thanks to exceptionally warm temperatures in the tropical Pacific Ocean.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Data centers are everywhere. Here's what they're doing to the planet.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:545e64bf7c845764c60cf71872af51901abdea19be035441da7193a72f232e1c</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T08:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/data-centers-are-everywhere-here-s-what-they-re-doing-to-the-planet/a-78789889--c90a71f162f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/data-centers-are-everywhere-here-s-what-they-re-doing-to-the-planet/a-78789889?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As data centers multiply to meet AI demand, they're straining power grids, draining water supplies, and reshaping the land and air around them.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Police say arson attack targeted defense firm</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2d2912f9725405b3e9411dccd1fc3d7deaf9f944add7ed808662b706b7e4305b</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-say-arson-attack-targeted-defense-firm/live-78818089--9ab675e17ffe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-say-arson-attack-targeted-defense-firm/live-78818089?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two people were arrested in connection with a small fire at a construction site near a defense tech company in Munich. Investigators are looking at a possible "political motive." More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US, Australia to boost defense ties amid China's growing influence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ab86e5c804e578c9f562a955b19bce77fd041c5575e4bf9413219e46f8c27e0b</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T07:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-australia-to-boost-defense-ties-amid-china-s-growing-influence/a-78815760--2e94abd96401.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-australia-to-boost-defense-ties-amid-china-s-growing-influence/a-78815760?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The two countries said they had agreed to speed up cooperation and boost US military presence in Australia to counter China's unprecedented military buildup.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: New York City Mayor Mamdani announces ban on AI for younger students</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2fb01c48c9d069d6679ecf50a228aa7a1445c6cfc0a3b9245741e82ac8b7f008</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T06:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-new-york-city-mayor-mamdani-announces-ban-on-ai-for-younger-students/a-78815448--e261eae34df5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-new-york-city-mayor-mamdani-announces-ban-on-ai-for-younger-students/a-78815448?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New York City is barring elementary and middle school students from using generative AI tools this school year. Meanwhile AI literacy classes and supervised pilot programs will be rolled out for high schoolers.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia to close branches of Germany's Goethe-Institut</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8c6f2a7b7c0ee0556efe39dd834c3456a15c77096fc160a00859a8f1ff60d6cf</id><updated>2026-09-03T19:20:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T03:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-to-close-branches-of-germany-s-goethe-institut/a-78815269--63dcf66c3fe5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-to-close-branches-of-germany-s-goethe-institut/a-78815269?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russian Foreign Minister Sergey Lavrov said the move was in response to Germany's decision to close the Russian House in Berlin after blaming Moscow for an attemped drone attack at Leipzig/Halle Airport.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
